{"id":"acebbed2a6b79dac","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-time-hierarchy.md","title":"thm-time-hierarchy (Deterministic Time Hierarchy Theorem)","display":"thm-time-hierarchy (Deterministic Time Hierarchy Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-time-constructible]]","[[28-df-big-oh]]","[[28-df-dtime]]"],"display":"thm-time-hierarchy (Deterministic Time Hierarchy Theorem)","label":"28-thm-time-hierarchy","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-time-hierarchy","Time Hierarchy Theorem","Deterministic Time Hierarchy"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dadc9163c924a179\" href=\"?note=dadc9163c924a179\" title=\"28-df-big-oh\">28-df-big-oh</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-time-hierarchy (Deterministic Time Hierarchy Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-time-hierarchy"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-time-hierarchy</span><span>Time Hierarchy Theorem</span><span>Deterministic Time Hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 均属于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35bdb2233dfc3e43\" href=\"?note=35bdb2233dfc3e43\" title=\"28-df-time-constructible\">28-df-time-constructible</a> 的时间可构造函数类，且对充分大的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n),g(n)\\ge n\">\\(f(n),g(n)\\ge n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}\\)</span> 采用本目录固定多带模型与常数因子约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o(g)\">\\(o(g)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dadc9163c924a179\" href=\"?note=dadc9163c924a179\" title=\"28-df-big-oh\">28-df-big-oh</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(n\\mapsto f(n)\\log_2 f(n)\\right)\\in o(g)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(n\\mapsto f(n)\\log_2 f(n)\\right)\\in o(g)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用带时钟的通用机在编码自身的输入上模拟候选机器并翻转答案。固定多带通用模拟产生对数时间开销；渐近余量使每个较小界机器在足够长的某个自身编码上被模拟完，得到对角矛盾。原书只详细展示线性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{1.5}\">\\(n^{1.5}\\)</span> 的特例，并说明一般情形类似；此处未把未展开的一般模拟细节升级为逐步核验。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理3.1及证明；印刷69页；PDF95页。一般陈述及特例对角证明已核对。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：一般时间时钟与通用模拟的全部细节尚未展开核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-time-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-big-oh","status":"resolved","id":"dadc9163c924a179","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-big-oh]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-dtime","status":"resolved","id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-dtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-time-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 均属于 [[28-df-time-constructible]] 的时间可构造函数类，且对充分大的 $n$ 有 $f(n),g(n)\\ge n$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-big-oh","status":"resolved","id":"dadc9163c924a179","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTIME}$ 采用本目录固定多带模型与常数因子约定；$o(g)$ 见 [[28-df-big-oh]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"f(n),g(n)\\ge n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"o(g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(n\\mapsto f(n)\\log_2 f(n)\\right)\\in o(g)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{DTIME}(f)\\subsetneq\\mathrm{DTIME}(g).","display":true},{"tex":"n^{1.5}","display":false}],"bytes":1592,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi]]。"},{"id":"915f4b454f730559","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["35bdb2233dfc3e43","dadc9163c924a179","9ed6fa1ce1934897"]}